Description:
List of Features:  
[500Ft Remote Range Meat Thermometer] - The Taimasi Wireless Thermometer is an advanced probe thermometric device boasting four probes, enabling you to not only supervise four distinct meats or four locations of a singular meat, but also the grill, smoker, or oven. Possessing an impressive wireless range of up to 500 feet, it permits you to oversee your culinary endeavors without necessitating your presence in the kitchen or yard.  
[Simple Setup & Optimal Accuracy] - The 4.7’’ color-coded temperature probes, accompanied by a 43’’ mesh cable, are constructed from food-grade stainless steel, capable of enduring temperatures of up to 716°F. Its temperature range spans from 32˚F to 572˚F with an accuracy of ±1.8˚F. Ensuring expedient data retrieval in merely 2-3 seconds, there is no synchronization required; this wireless digital thermometer is pre-configured prior to shipment.  
[USDA Preset Temperature Settings] - In addition to providing diverse cooking temperatures for 12 assorted meats, this culinary thermometer is also imbued with five USDA-sanctioned ‘doneness’ levels, facilitating the effortless preparation of your meat to these specifications. Moreover, all pre-programmed temperatures can be modified to cater to your personal palate.  
[Timer & Alarm] - This grill thermometer is equipped with a countdown/up timer and alarms, functioning actively while simultaneously monitoring meat temperatures. When the designated time elapses or the temperature threshold is attained, it emits a beep to alert you. It furthermore features a backlit LCD, a magnetic back, and a built-in stand, thus offering ease of use in dim lighting; it can be affixed to a metal surface or set upon a desk, or hung on a wall.  
[Best Customer Service] - Package Contents: 1x thermometer transmitter, 1x wireless receiver, 4x probes with wires, 4x AAA batteries, 2x grill clips (for the convenient attachment of probes to the grill), 1x food injector (designed for injecting seasoning into meats), and 1 user manual. This product serves as an exemplary gift for any occasion, perfect for barbecue, oven cooking, and baking. We also provide a warranty and replacement probes; should you have any inquiries regarding the product, please feel free to contact us.  

